msgid ":mod:`!html.entities` --- Definitions of HTML general entities"
msgstr ""

msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/html/entities.py`"
msgstr ""

msgid "This module defines four dictionaries, :data:`html5`, :data:`name2codepoint`, :data:`codepoint2name`, and :data:`entitydefs`."
msgstr ""

msgid "A dictionary that maps HTML5 named character references [#]_ to the equivalent Unicode character(s), e.g. ``html5['gt;'] == '>'``. Note that the trailing semicolon is included in the name (e.g. ``'gt;'``), however some of the names are accepted by the standard even without the semicolon: in this case the name is present with and without the ``';'``. See also :func:`html.unescape`."
msgstr ""

msgid "A dictionary mapping XHTML 1.0 entity definitions to their replacement text in ISO Latin-1."
msgstr ""

msgid "A dictionary that maps HTML4 entity names to the Unicode code points."
msgstr ""

msgid "A dictionary that maps Unicode code points to HTML4 entity names."
msgstr ""

